        <inbodydescription>
<para>Bail out if the expression does not contain an UDiv expression. Uniform values which are not loop invariant require operations to strip out the lowest bits. For now just look for UDivs and use it to avoid re-writing UDIV-free expressions for other lanes to limit compile time.</para>
        </inbodydescription>
